@startuml
title Aquality Store - Visitante

left to right direction

actor "Usuario Anónimo" as Anonymous

rectangle "Aquality Store" {

    usecase "Registrarse" as Register
    usecase "Iniciar sesión" as Login
    usecase "Recuperar contraseña" as ResetPassword

    usecase "Ver productos" as Products
    usecase "Ver artículo\nen detalle" as Detail

    usecase "Agregar al carrito" as AddCart
    usecase "Contactar" as Contact
}

Anonymous --> Register
Anonymous --> Login
Anonymous --> ResetPassword
Anonymous --> Products
Anonymous --> Detail
Anonymous --> AddCart
Anonymous --> Contact

note right of AddCart
El visitante puede explorar
y agregar productos al carrito.
La compra requiere
autenticación.
end note

@enduml